hadiths[5]{hadithnumber,text}:
"126","[AI-translation] Hum se riwayat ki 'Abd bin Humaid ne, farmaya: Hum se riwayat ki 'Affan bin Muslim ne, farmaya: Hum se riwayat ki 'Abdullah bin Hassaan ne, apni dadiyon se, Qailah bint Makhramah se, ke unhone Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko masjid mein dekha, aur wo qurfusa ki halat mein baithe the. Unhon ne kaha: Pas jab maine Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko jalse mein khushoo ki halat mein dekha, to mujhe khauf se kaanp aaya."
"127","[AI-translation] Hum se riwayat ki Sa'eed bin 'Abdur Rahman Makhzumi ne, aur doosre logon ne, unhon ne kaha: Hum se riwayat ki Sufyan ne, Zuhri se, 'Abbad bin Tameem se, apne chacha se, ke unhone Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko masjid mein pair phailaaye hue dekha, ek pair dusre par rakhe hue."
"128","[AI-translation] Hum se riwayat ki Salamah bin Shabib ne, farmaya: Hum se riwayat ki 'Abdullah bin Ibrahim Madani ne, farmaya: Hum se riwayat ki Ishaq bin Muhammad Ansari ne, Rubaih bin 'Abdur Rahman bin Abi Sa'eed se, apne walid se, apne dad Abu Sa'eed Khudri se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab masjid mein baihthe, to apne haathon se ihtibaa karte."
"129","[AI-translation] Hum se riwayat ki 'Abbaas bin Muhammad Duri Baghdadi ne, farmaya: Hum se riwayat ki Ishaq bin Mansoor ne, Israeel se, Simaak bin Harb se, Jabir bin Samurah se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko apne baayein taraf takiye par takiya lagaye hue dekha."
"130","[AI-translation] Hum se riwayat ki Humaid bin Mas'adah ne, farmaya: Hum se riwayat ki Bishr bin Mufazzal ne, farmaya: Hum se riwayat ki Jurairi ne, 'Abdur Rahman bin Abi Bakrah se, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya main tumhein kabeera gunaahon mein se sab se bara kabeera na bataun? Unhon ne kaha: Bali, Ya Rasool Allah! Farmaya: Allah ke saath shirk karna, aur walidain ki na-farmani. Kaha: aur Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) baith gaye, halanke wo takiya lagaye hue the, farmaya: aur jhoothi gawahi, ya jhoothi baat. Kaha: phir Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) yeh kehte rahe, yahan tak ke hum ne kaha: kaash ke wo chup ho jate."
